E32E4666BA59212","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521028016:1":{"text":"现在这种时候，能从家里拿出余粮分给我们的人肯定非富即贵，更何况您身边还跟着两位仆人。只有这样称呼您才不会失礼。","source_cn":"现在这种时候，能从家里拿出余粮分给我们的人肯定非富即贵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EFB551BC9D7380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1521028016":{"text":"现在这种时候，能从家里拿出余粮分给我们的人肯定非富即贵，更何况您身边还跟着两位仆人。只有这样称呼您才不会失礼。","source_cn":"现在这种时候，能从家里拿出余粮分给我们的人肯定非富即贵，更何况您身边还跟着两位仆人。只有这样称呼您才不会失礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EFB551BC9D7380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521028017:0":{"text":"……我们不是他的仆人。","source_cn":"……我们不是他的仆人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F39AEA12B38CA99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521028019:0":{"text":"这……","source_cn":"这……<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA71C5CD171988A5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521028020:0":{"text":"他们是我的护卫，不是仆人。","source_cn":"他们是我的护卫，不是仆人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC1C7D6FE4618D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521028021:0":{"text":"哦哦，我果然没看错……您果然是位好心的公子。","source_cn":"哦哦，我果然没看错……您果然是位好心的公子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75D59D8654E40A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521028022:0":{"text":"小公子……我可以问你一个问题吗？","source_cn":"小公子……我可以问你一个问题吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7922886FF44AD2AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1521028023:0":{"text":"可以啊，你问吧。","source_cn":"可以啊，你问吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B317B0A8EA3738","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521028024:0":{"text":"那个……你有没有见过领主殿下？","source_cn":"那个……你有没有见过领主殿下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x299BCF841CDEB298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521028025:0":{"text":"——卡托！\n爸爸和你说过，不许在外面议论领主的事……！","source_cn":"——卡托！\\n爸爸和你说过，不许在外面议论领主的事……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21D564BCFAAA947F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say